WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.876 --> 00:00:04.754
In my 20s, I stumbled my way in.

00:00:04.838 --> 00:00:09.008 position:64%
<i>And what I found is a secretive 
Christian organization called The Family,</i>

00:00:09.092 --> 00:00:12.095 position:58%
<i>that have been hiding in plain sight 
for over 80 years.</i>

00:00:12.178 --> 00:00:15.014
<i>This was a group 
with tentacles around the world.</i>

00:00:15.098 --> 00:00:19.144
A humble example of leadership
that the world has never seen.

00:00:19.227 --> 00:00:22.731
<i>A breathtaking enmeshment 
of church and state.</i>

00:00:22.814 --> 00:00:25.775
<i>There were congressmen, 
senators, world leaders.</i>

00:00:25.859 --> 00:00:28.403
<i>And they say it's about faith,</i>

00:00:28.486 --> 00:00:32.365 position:61%
but there's a shared understanding that
what we're really about here is power.

00:00:32.449 --> 00:00:34.784
I'd like to single out Doug Coe.

00:00:34.868 --> 00:00:37.162
Doug Coe and all of his associates,
I'm grateful.

00:00:37.245 --> 00:00:40.165
<i>Doug Coe is the longtime leader 
of The Family.</i>

00:00:40.248 --> 00:00:43.626 position:64%
<i>He's the most powerful man in Washington 
you've never heard of.</i>

00:00:43.710 --> 00:00:46.171
<i>He said, "The more invisible
you can make your organization,</i>

00:00:46.254 --> 00:00:48.506
<i>the more influence it will have."</i>

00:00:49.841 --> 00:00:52.135
<i>Jesus plus nothing.</i>

00:00:52.218 --> 00:00:53.261
It's a powerful thing.

00:00:53.928 --> 00:00:55.722 position:56%
<i>Using the National Prayer Breakfast,</i>

00:00:55.805 --> 00:00:57.432 line:0%
<i>they dispatch representatives</i>

00:00:57.515 --> 00:00:59.267 line:0%
<i>to build relationships 
with foreign leaders.</i>

00:00:59.350 --> 00:01:02.604 line:0%
That is exactly the kind of meeting
that I would want to exploit.

00:01:03.396 --> 00:01:08.485 position:63%
<i>For The Family, Jesus says, "We must go
to those who are in positions of power."</i>

00:01:08.568 --> 00:01:12.489
<i>God always uses imperfect vessels 
to do his perfect work.</i>

00:01:12.572 --> 00:01:13.740 position:59%
President Trump's an imperfect vessel.

00:01:13.823 --> 00:01:15.575
<i>Jesus is the answer,</i>

00:01:15.658 --> 00:01:18.369 position:58%
but Jesus and Capitol Hill don't mix.

00:01:19.954 --> 00:01:22.582
Because we want our family
to stay together.

